      "content": "TL 10 NW                   ST MICHAEL           POTTERSCROUCH LANE                                                 (north west side)                                                 POTTERS CROUCH 9/298                                           Barn 35 metres NE of                                                 farmhouse at Windridge                                                 Farm. GV                                              II Barn.   C18.   Well-preserved example.  Timber frame.   5 bays. Weatherboarded;  some red brick.  Plain tile roof.  Single purlin roof.   Gabled cart entrance on centre SW side flanked by contemporary lean-to ranges.  The barn wall at the SE end on this side incorporates a fragment of C17 studwork with red brick infill. Listing NGR: TL1246605798"
    }
